# Research Direction Improvement

For novel mechanisms or experiments over 8 GPU-hours, use
`skills/research-direction-improve.md` and run:

```bash
uv run python scripts/research_direction_doctor.py <proposal.md>
```

Do not describe an idea as completely novel. State the search cutoff, coverage,
closest prior work, and the exact delta. A proposal is pilot-ready only at
100/100 with all doctors passed and independent adversarial review recorded.
The PASS must include a hashed evidence bundle; Markdown assertions alone never
count. A score of 100 also requires two provider-distinct Ed25519 review
signatures rooted in the external read-only trust store configured by trusted
CI, not a proposal-controlled repository file. Compute remains FAIL while the
real model loop, benchmark adapter, container smoke, or Slurm dry-run is unavailable.

Parallel work is limited to independent search cells. One owner performs
coupled synthesis and resolves reviewer defects. Fix the highest-impact defect
per wave; preserve every score and rejected hypothesis in the audit trail.
